<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Burnham Pacific started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Burnham Pacific started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers started coverage of Burnham Pacific Properties Inc Tuesday with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- The 12-month price target was set at $16.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Diego company were unchanged at 13-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
